---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Wonder Maker" description="El mejor fangame de SMM2 con estética Wonder. Editor de niveles para PC, Android y Linux.">
  <section class="relative py-20 md:py-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_rgba(34,197,94,0.1)_0%,_transparent_60%)] pointer-events-none" />
    
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <img
        src="/wonder-maker/nobg_logo.png"
        alt="Wonder Maker"
        class="h-40 md:h-56 mx-auto mb-8"
      />
      
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-400 mb-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        El editor de Mario definitivo creado por <span class="text-white font-semibold">Manzft</span>
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
        Construye y juega niveles con la estética y fluidez de <span class="text-accent">Mario Wonder</span>
      </p>

      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-dark-800 rounded-full text-sm text-gray-400 mb-10">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse" />
        Beta v1.1.1 disponible
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#download" class="btn-primary">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
          </svg>
          Descargar Beta
        </a>
        <a href="#discord" class="btn-outline">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.317 4.3698a19.7913 19.7913 0 00-4.8851-1.5152.0741.0741 0 00-.0785.0371c-.211.3753-.4447.8648-.6083 1.2495-1.8447-.2762-3.68-.2762-5.4868 0-.1636-.3933-.4058-.8742-.6177-1.2495a.077.077 0 00-.0785-.037 19.7363 19.7363 0 00-4.8852 1.515.0699.0699 0 00-.0321.0277C.5334 9.0458-.319 13.5799.0992 18.0578a.0824.0824 0 00.0312.0561c2.0528 1.5076 4.0413 2.4228 5.9929 3.0294a.0777.0777 0 00.0842-.0276c.4616-.6304.8731-1.2952 1.226-1.9942a.076.076 0 00-.0416-.1057c-.6528-.2476-1.2743-.5495-1.8722-.8923a.077.077 0 01-.0076-.1277c.1258-.0943.2517-.1923.3718-.2914a.0743.0743 0 01.0776-.0105c3.9278 1.7933 8.18 1.7933 12.0614 0a.0739.0739 0 01.0785.0095c.1202.099.246.1981.3728.2924a.077.077 0 01-.0066.1276 12.2986 12.2986 0 01-1.873.8914.0766.0766 0 00-.0407.1067c.3604.698.7719 1.3628 1.225 1.9932a.076.076 0 00.0842.0286c1.961-.6067 3.9495-1.5219 6.0023-3.0294a.077.077 0 00.0313-.0552c.5004-5.177-.8382-9.6739-3.5485-13.6604a.061.061 0 00-.0312-.0286zM8.02 15.3312c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9555-2.4189 2.157-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.9555 2.4189-2.1569 2.4189zm7.9748 0c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9554-2.4189 2.1569-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.946 2.4189-2.1568 2.4189Z"/></svg>
          Wonder Cave
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <img
        src="/wonder-maker/screenshot.webp"
        alt="Wonder Maker Screenshot"
        class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-dark-600 shadow-2xl"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="section-title">Estilos de juego</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Esto es solo una beta, habrán más estilos en la versión final.</p>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="card p-6 text-center">
        <img src="/wonder-maker/smb.png" alt="SMB" class="w-full h-32 object-contain mb-4" />
        <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg">Super Mario Bros</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">El estilo clásico de Mario pero modernizado.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6 text-center">
        <img src="/wonder-maker/smb3.png" alt="SMB3" class="w-full h-32 object-contain mb-4" />
        <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg">Super Mario Bros 3</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Vuela con el Tanooki con nuevas físicas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6 text-center">
        <img src="/wonder-maker/smw.png" alt="SMW" class="w-full h-32 object-contain mb-4" />
        <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg">Super Mario World</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">El mejor Mario 2D de los 90.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-6 text-center">
        <img src="/wonder-maker/nsmbu.png" alt="NSMBU" class="w-full h-32 object-contain mb-4" />
        <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-lg">New Super Mario Bros U</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Juega en este moderno estilo de forma nativa.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="download" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="section-title">Descarga la Beta</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Elige tu plataforma y empieza a crear niveles.</p>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <a href="#" class="card p-8 text-center group block hover:border-accent/50">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <img src="/wonder-maker/icon.png" alt="" class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Windows</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">EXE</p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95">
          Descargar
        </span>
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="card p-8 text-center group block hover:border-accent/50">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <img src="/wonder-maker/icon.png" alt="" class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Android</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">APK</p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-8 py-4 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95">
          Descargar
        </span>
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="card p-8 text-center group block hover:border-accent/50">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <img src="/wonder-maker/icon.png" alt="" class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Linux</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6">X86_64</p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-8 py-4 bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95">
          Descargar
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="discord" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="card p-10 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-6">
        <img src="/wonder-maker/icon.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Wonder Cave</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Únete al servidor oficial de Discord para estar al tanto de las novedades, reportar bugs y compartir tus niveles.
      </p>
      <a href="https://discord.com/invite/csGS3eKxvD" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-[#5865f2] hover:bg-[#4752c4] text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.317 4.3698a19.7913 19.7913 0 00-4.8851-1.5152.0741.0741 0 00-.0785.0371c-.211.3753-.4447.8648-.6083 1.2495-1.8447-.2762-3.68-.2762-5.4868 0-.1636-.3933-.4058-.8742-.6177-1.2495a.077.077 0 00-.0785-.037 19.7363 19.7363 0 00-4.8852 1.515.0699.0699 0 00-.0321.0277C.5334 9.0458-.319 13.5799.0992 18.0578a.0824.0824 0 00.0312.0561c2.0528 1.5076 4.0413 2.4228 5.9929 3.0294a.0777.0777 0 00.0842-.0276c.4616-.6304.8731-1.2952 1.226-1.9942a.076.076 0 00-.0416-.1057c-.6528-.2476-1.2743-.5495-1.8722-.8923a.077.077 0 01-.0076-.1277c.1258-.0943.2517-.1923.3718-.2914a.0743.0743 0 01.0776-.0105c3.9278 1.7933 8.18 1.7933 12.0614 0a.0739.0739 0 01.0785.0095c.1202.099.246.1981.3728.2924a.077.077 0 01-.0066.1276 12.2986 12.2986 0 01-1.873.8914.0766.0766 0 00-.0407.1067c.3604.698.7719 1.3628 1.225 1.9932a.076.076 0 00.0842.0286c1.961-.6067 3.9495-1.5219 6.0023-3.0294a.077.077 0 00.0313-.0552c.5004-5.177-.8382-9.6739-3.5485-13.6604a.061.061 0 00-.0312-.0286zM8.02 15.3312c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9555-2.4189 2.157-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.9555 2.4189-2.1569 2.4189zm7.9748 0c-1.1825 0-2.1569-1.0857-2.1569-2.419 0-1.3332.9554-2.4189 2.1569-2.4189 1.2108 0 2.1757 1.0952 2.1568 2.419 0 1.3332-.946 2.4189-2.1568 2.4189Z"/></svg>
        Unirse a Wonder Cave
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
